From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mscoree: strong name key, hash size and public key token functions

StrongNameKeyGen/KeyGenEx (RSA signing pair as a CryptoAPI private blob,
temporary or named container, SN_LEAVE_KEY), KeyInstall, KeyDelete,
GetPublicKey (from a key blob or a container, in the strong name public
key layout), SignatureSize, TokenFromPublicKey (last eight bytes of the
SHA-1, reversed), HashSize, ErrorInfo and FreeBuffer. They were stubs.

Gate: test/mscoree-sn-gate.sh (64 and 32 bit; the token is checked against
a vector computed with hashlib outside Wine). Mutants SG_MUTANT_SN_TOKEN,
_HASH0, _SIZE, _LEAVE and _ALG are caught.
---
--- a/dlls/mscoree/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/mscoree/Makefile.in
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	metadata.c \
 	metahost.c \
 	mscoree_classes.idl \
-	mscoree_main.c
+	mscoree_main.c \
+	strongname.c
 
 metahost_EXTRADEFS = -DINSTALL_DATADIR="\"${datadir}\""
--- a/dlls/mscoree/mscoree.spec
+++ b/dlls/mscoree/mscoree.spec
@@ -92,25 +92,25 @@
 @ stub RuntimeReleaseHandle
 @ stub SetTargetForVTableEntry
 @ stub StrongNameCompareAssemblies
-@ stub StrongNameErrorInfo
-@ stub StrongNameFreeBuffer
+@ stdcall StrongNameErrorInfo()
+@ stdcall StrongNameFreeBuffer(ptr)
 @ stub StrongNameGetBlob
 @ stub StrongNameGetBlobFromImage
-@ stub StrongNameGetPublicKey
-@ stub StrongNameHashSize
-@ stub StrongNameKeyDelete
-@ stub StrongNameKeyGen
-@ stub StrongNameKeyGenEx
-@ stub StrongNameKeyInstall
+@ stdcall StrongNameGetPublicKey(wstr ptr long ptr ptr)
+@ stdcall StrongNameHashSize(long ptr)
+@ stdcall StrongNameKeyDelete(wstr)
+@ stdcall StrongNameKeyGen(wstr long ptr ptr)
+@ stdcall StrongNameKeyGenEx(wstr long long ptr ptr)
+@ stdcall StrongNameKeyInstall(wstr ptr long)
 @ stub StrongNameSignatureGeneration
 @ stub StrongNameSignatureGenerationEx
-@ stub StrongNameSignatureSize
+@ stdcall StrongNameSignatureSize(ptr long ptr)
 @ stdcall StrongNameSignatureVerification(wstr long ptr)
 @ stdcall StrongNameSignatureVerificationEx(wstr long ptr)
 @ stub StrongNameSignatureVerificationFromImage
 @ stdcall StrongNameTokenFromAssembly(wstr ptr ptr)
 @ stub StrongNameTokenFromAssemblyEx
-@ stub StrongNameTokenFromPublicKey
+@ stdcall StrongNameTokenFromPublicKey(ptr long ptr ptr)
 @ stub TranslateSecurityAttributes
 @ stdcall _CorDllMain(long long ptr)
 @ stdcall _CorExeMain2(ptr long ptr ptr ptr)
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/dlls/mscoree/strongname.c
@@ -0,0 +1,355 @@
